    {
     "ref": "mame:src/devices/machine/z80sio.cpp",
     "function": "z80sio_device::cd_ba_r"
    }
   ],
   "rows": [
    {
     "n": "1",
     "on": "is",
     "of": "doc",
     "text": "B/A, Channel A or B Select, High selects Channel B and defines which channel the CPU transfer reaches; address bit A0 is often used for it.",
     "quotes": [
      {
       "ref": "datasheet:UM0081.raw.txt",
       "lines": "7817-7820",
       "sha": "f614a52d17685c4d1345075a6a03c3b06c1b6017a7ba7f79559e2a934a28bc95"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": "2",
     "on": "read",
     "of": "doc",
     "text": "C/D, Control or Data Select, High selects Control, and defines the type of information transfer performed.",
     "quotes": [
      {
       "ref": "datasheet:UM0081.raw.txt",
       "lines": "7821-7822",
       "sha": "1511dc923f3d81f2df49479be31426bf7d6e379c8f9463d8047c0943fbd857cc"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": "3",
     "on": "is",
     "of": "doc",
     "text": "B/A and C/D are the command structure addressing controls, normally controlled by the CPU address bus, as Table 11 shows.",
     "quotes": [
      {
       "ref": "datasheet:UM0081.raw.txt",
       "lines": "10532-10534",
       "sha": "71d6e9c19b131fa558cf26e2219a840e0f34c94f3d14e07b3be4a4a46248db92"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": "5",
     "on": "is",
     "of": "doc",
     "text": "Figures 114 through 117 show the timing for programming the write registers and transferring data and status.",
     "quotes": [
      {
       "ref": "datasheet:UM0081.raw.txt",
       "lines": "10534-10536",
       "sha": "3de2f874ad45f498c46185e2e594ea80209660b922581bfaa0c1795b1aaff4ea"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": "4",
     "on": "place",
     "of": "mame",
     "text": "In cd_ba_r, offset bit 0 is B/A and offset bit 1 is C/D, and the call goes to the selected channel's control or data read.",
     "quotes": [
      {
       "ref": "mame:src/devices/machine/z80sio.cpp",
       "lines": "898",
       "sha": "8584cea2848aab9cf34fcd4b200596a838cc42f39dbebff4d03226b4c5c7a5d4"
      },
      {
       "ref": "mame:src/devices/machine/z80sio.cpp",
       "lines": "899",
       "sha": "bd1a3f42a98cd859df66e1fb27287b9083592469d8c9005ae67f1f666322141f"
      },
      {
       "ref": "mame:src/devices/machine/z80sio.cpp",
       "lines": "900",
       "sha": "27a0dc22e454fc0016b7e5a1c76ed9ab2f4789d6ab842164422cb3f7c5accd9f"
      },
